          "module_id": "sec05-m03",
          "unit_id": "sec05-u03",
          "front": "When does the move over law require a lane change rather than only slowing?",
          "back": "A stopped emergency vehicle calls for slowing down everywhere, but the additional duty to change lanes applies only on a four lane highway and only when the change is safe.",
